    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_explicit" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual states the rule for the category in terms. Held separately because the three-category sort is how Part 22 organises everything after it, and a vocabulary without the categories cannot follow the argument."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 8e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/4%231> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether the three categories should be one concept with three values rather than three concepts. This pass holds two of the three and that asymmetry is itself a defect."@en-AU ;
